			"Message": "chore(Project): Update submodules with build configuration and formatting normalization\n\nUpdate multiple editor element submodules to resolve build pipeline inconsistencies and standardize code formatting across the ecosystem.\n\n**Cocoon:** Standardize ESBuild configuration and export syntax, migrating ambiguous default imports to explicit named exports and consolidating environment constants to prepare for upcoming gRPC server ordering fixes.\n\n**Output:** Re-align 100+ compiled artifacts to a helpers-first shim ordering and 2-space indentation. This prevents forward-reference hazards during module evaluation and ensures regex-based transform plugins match against TypeScript source patterns correctly.\n\n**Wind:** Normalize ESBuild configuration to 4-space indentation and consolidate multi-line export blocks. Collapse multiline bridge shape `Pick` type definitions for improved readability across workbench service implementations.\n\n**Worker:** Revert ESBuild configuration to 2-space indentation and standardize export block formatting.\n\n**Maintain:** Update submodule pointer.\n\nThese changes are purely cosmetic and structural, ensuring consistent build output, preventing runtime evaluation hazards, and aligning all elements with project styling guidelines. No functional behavior is altered.",
			"SHA": "7d937e8d07beb920a0567b8a8468cfa63f8f8e7f"
		},
		{
